th softer merchandise exports by value; the large swings in 2020-21 reflect the pandemic collapse of belly-hold capacity on passenger flights.^A domestic tonne is counted at both origin and destination airport, so domestic freight is not comparable with rail or port tonnage."},{"question":"What are the caveats?","answer":"AAI compiles the data from airports and states that it is subject to revision; this series replaces each month with the revised year-ago figure from the following year's release. Some months may be absent where AAI's summary could not be read."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","note":"Taken from AAI's monthly 'Traffic News Summary' (all operational Indian airports). Each month's figure is the provisional number from its own release, replaced by the revised year-ago figure printed in the following year's release once available; the latest 12 months are therefore provisional. A few months may be missing where AAI's summary could not be read.","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:31:12+00:00"}